{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":262741,\"title\":\"Youthful Glory\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"When General Jiang Xu returns to the capital after eight years to investigate military corruption, he enters a strategic marriage with a strong-willed noblewoman, Ming Tan. As they navigate political intrigue and work to protect their families, an unexpected romance gradually blossoms between them.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qnvUc7dlsvRj807HbmkReWYJ77t.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tLewxYU1m43DS2Man8GRtHYQExI.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":12,\"year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":30,\"createdBy\":[\"Bu Zhi Shi Ke Cai\"],\"networks\":[\"Mango TV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4655666,\"name\":\"Qie Guowei\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znryUEvbdpYXpe3HazOqbKSfpeR.jpg\"},{\"id\":3180260,\"name\":\"Min Guohui\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GGHBXYoCfH2AhpiVjYdX20y3Px.jpg\"},{\"id\":1982522,\"name\":\"Song Weilong\",\"character\":\"Jiang Xu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91EBpDeOvBRQ4Kh6p15LQwWshdR.jpg\"},{\"id\":3590388,\"name\":\"Bao Shangen\",\"character\":\"Ming Tan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z0DCiZ6k97DKWfnqSwQEvLmuu3O.jpg\"},{\"id\":2190499,\"name\":\"Dai Luwa\",\"character\":\"Bai Minmin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4yJZSb5RAUprTdS2dW5TdiVAWp4.jpg\"},{\"id\":4147552,\"name\":\"Quan Yilun\",\"character\":\"Shu Jingran\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sg2QgHDX51EERbfN4eOmUn8djmH.jpg\"},{\"id\":2869093,\"name\":\"Ke Ying\",\"character\":\"Yun Yi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2jnZP6F0h3uPEJ7qxcLf1dAutu8.jpg\"},{\"id\":2293240,\"name\":\"Qin Xiaoxuan\",\"character\":\"Liu Mo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/46j4qkhhKGIu6AbUnZCagPOB28t.jpg\"},{\"id\":1824165,\"name\":\"Bai Shu\",\"character\":\"Zhang Huaiyu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dj5Fl8QWEStjxnYb7Oshx6250rl.jpg\"},{\"id\":4579865,\"name\":\"Wang Ke\",\"character\":\"Ming Chu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ze1gx51SaTRbUqAFbFj1FqJ5QDV.jpg\"},{\"id\":2496899,\"name\":\"Yang Boxiao\",\"character\":\"Lu Ting\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yrCjTVExTv8xWV4jJcDiobDr3Fc.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"Q2MeVpfIQwE\",\"name\":\"【ENG SUB Trailer】宋威龙包上恩酷王爷娇小姐逗趣甜恋💘 | 韶华若锦  | MangoTV Drama\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":244015,\"title\":\"Our Love Triangle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3uB0AM3v8BQRrTCywTjoHjN31jo.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43000000000000005,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":280889,\"title\":\"Bada Naam Karenge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldO5HuJC3pUMOJRtGyG50KEF4YU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4283783783783784,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94707,\"title\":\"The Love by Hypnotic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7TdSKz8lepKCFTxn7D4C6b6s55.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4233766233766234,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":312534,\"title\":\"Burning Rose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPFnWMqgPeexeAMabsswcOiniSk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42238805970149257,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":280876,\"title\":\"Shan Shan Lai Chi De Ni\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gcVBzd6nf8NSAkv6xxQrKR5aUHg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4218181818181818,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":280848,\"title\":\"Home About Us\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dRZNd8l50P2YKVLZ4BdOTBCVqDs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42142857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":280882,\"title\":\"Your Laugh Is Very Alluring\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41956521739130437,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128166,\"title\":\"Blinded Kiss\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myUtrTTFTbLnBNLe2iLxi0M94zp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41836734693877553,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":280846,\"title\":\"传闻中的宁清漪\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sgJyl2BeVt232IAL0f5JSt0t6Eh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":60556,\"title\":\"Bitten\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/guhxl5I8J1WVEA3yeDt8hwgpYWx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41704545454545455,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":211432,\"title\":\"Tsuka no Ma no Ichika\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7bCJ4mX68zFnMyt5bnhbSodNjIB.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41651376146788993,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":211436,\"title\":\"Warera ga Paradise\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMh61P275SvIYuH7VjCCCG4yP9N.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41401869158878507,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vo5TZMAuXNjH2nyeDXBDEJo0qXB.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-05-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Hoping to end their engagement, Ming Tan tries to expose Liang Zixuan's affair, only to uncover a secret. As she investigates, she encounters Jiang Xu.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cu7WwPEIlcmOhqBtdqjztC8H5g1.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-19\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"At the emperor's palace, Jiang Xu presents evidence of a conspiracy. The Liang family hatches a plot to secure Liang Zixuan's engagement to Ming Tan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yiPlS0no2NDhWuraEiACCV2d4c2.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-19\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan searches for Zhu'er, who faces a threat to her life as she prepares to give birth. Ming Chu stirs up trouble at home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/61N5rDfahvhaelKBkZXD9Km8tSI.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-19\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"An enraged Ming Tingyuan revokes his daughter's betrothal. As the court searches for another suitable match, Jiang Xu makes a surprising proposal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mUgPOUadpxyZ4T8QVBlid3IDIDp.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-19\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan receives an edict proclaiming her new engagement and soon becomes horrified after learning who her betrothed is.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hpf0nZU8lxiNzwTgenm63RVDE3V.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-20\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"The rivalry between the sisters escalates as Ming Chu stages a dangerous scheme against Ming Tan, prompting their father to make a difficult decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eiAMFzzGMIApmAKwTbfjx3YLxYm.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-20\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan prepares for her wedding and comes to an agreement with Jiang Xu about their partnership. But an enemy strikes on the eve of their celebration.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b1pyTQDGPXVAS6zxvw5IZfz4IAj.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-20\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"With Ming Tan nowhere to be found, Jiang Xu sets out to locate her. Meanwhile, Ming Tingyuan must cover up her disappearance as the wedding begins.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9NCD0qYHnhFL6WIagQ1Ew1R5QW.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-20\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan agrees to help her friend, whose father is in prison. Later, she attempts to spice up her marriage, but will she catch Jiang Xu's attention?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/biDy3mkRltsQmDwF94z0lwD3CIW.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-22\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Gu Jiurou's visit to her father ends in disaster, and she soon embarks on a perilous mission. Ming Tan comes to her aid and encounters a familiar figure.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/akaxbM235s4YpVexzV2jdEMDeAP.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-22\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Jiang Xu clears up an intimate misunderstanding between himself and Ming Tan. Later, the two learn of a calamity affecting the people of Lizhou.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ffAgyMGV6e1EIzIJu16AktMxexj.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Jiang Xu becomes jealous as Ming Tan commissions a painting of the popular Shu Jingran, which she turns into souvenirs to support the relief efforts.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5TmkZ2gsa1JVWiFlzbHa2mktPlv.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-24\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"Bai Minmin entertains a suitor, but Zhang Huaiyu intervenes. Jiang Xu defends Ming Tan from a noble's vulgar advances and faces the emperor's judgment.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xbwEVbYVU2Mr1qxM2LHGCEMlsO.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-25\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"The addition of Yun Yi to the household infuriates Ming Tan, until she learns why Jiang Xu took her in. Liu Mo makes a confession.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m13sSxo3VnLjSd7sDhrbpM9TRQ1.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-26\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"As troubling reports arrive from Lizhou, the court rallies against Ming Tingyuan. Soon after, he receives a devastating imperial edict.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uJgvF1xaa0vwWhC88sb5rHUcxl2.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-26\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"As Ming Tingyuan faces a grim sentence, Jiang Xu looks for a way to overturn it. The emperor entrusts Zhang Huaiyu with an important — but deadly — task.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qlsnY6U6zMyXIoV7dSYCAXtrWm3.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-27\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan attempts to visit her father, only to encounter a tragedy. As the rift in their marriage widens, she ends her agreement with Jiang Xu.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/TEHQxLjcw0T0L5vIvcN59IWt4H.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-27\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"At the market, Ming Tan chances upon wares that could help prove Ming Tingyuan's innocence. Jiang Xu prepares to look into his friend's disappearance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/baAgA2xUY4V2oAsKLjblFywi4je.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-28\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan accompanies Jiang Xu on his journey to Lingzhou, but along the way, they take an unexpected detour to visit someone dear to them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cWtfcDnAxanJa9Erlt6PM9dCnBm.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-28\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"An ambush forces the group to leave one of their friends behind. In Lingzhou, Ming Tan conceals her identity to gather information.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z6988L07w57LMeQWgE5BeilR4If.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-29\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"Jiang Xu and Shu Jingran attend a banquet hosted by their enemies and continue to search for their missing friends. Ming Tan draws unwanted attention.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWXvySK13iOkj2P8ene9oednUlU.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-29\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"While Jiang Xu hounds the Su family for their unpaid taxes, Ming Tan finds a lead in her investigation. Shu Jingran undertakes a covert mission.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3CI97jp5le5G36LbP0DE8iFWZPk.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"A banquet hosted by the Su family sparks jealousy between Ming Tan and Jiang Xu. Meanwhile, Jiang Xu's scheme with Yu Bozhong reaches a turning point.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iJiEJLmJahnI8XkVzzFXWAUdsF1.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-31\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"Shu Jinrang and Yun Yi stage a cunning deception to draw out their enemies. Su Errong tries to catch Jiang Xu and Ming Tan in a compromising situation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pCYgCqsBbVnau6H7FGb2mvgV316.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-01\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"Ming Tan uncovers details about the smuggling trade at the auction. The Su family pins a murder on Jiang Xu as he investigates their dealings.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pRR3W0M4qU8v8TDnZ11RnEfdR1I.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"With evidence mounting against them, the authorities corner the Su family, who retaliate with an assault. Jiang Xu joins the fray to rescue Ming Tan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/piK8YgS5bODafSjylTK0NeGnqHF.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"The emperor roots out the traitors in the capital, but their leader proves difficult to pin down. Ming Tan and Jiang Xu share a heartfelt moment.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ualF2o7inkrs6fAI2pMpeftCHx8.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"After Su Wenchun's arrest, the empire comes under threat from rebels and the army of Nanlu, whose leader attempts to win Ming Tan over.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9vB2OfJmv25Od5FGmgvA0zH1mzp.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"As war ravages the empire, Ming Tingyuan and Jiang Xu outmaneuver the rebels. Meanwhile, Liu Mo seeks revenge against his old ally.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzfyTn7HzvEEdiXDVVu3kv3e9lk.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"The empire begins to recover from the turmoil caused by the rebellion. Alongside their friends, Jiang Xu and Ming Tan prepare for the future.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5eVtSC8nbbDXtXfoU7RUWdJbgBh.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-02\",\"runtime\":47}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-05-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}